<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Dear {{lead.First Name:default= }},</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">UK universities are facing a future they are not ready for.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Our recent survey on international admissions capabilities, based on feedback from professional services leaders like you, paints a stark picture:</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><strong>Zero</strong> universities are considered "future-ready" (80%+ score).</li> 
<li>Confidence is low: Leaders rate their confidence in being "fit for purpose by 2028" at a mere <strong>4.3 out of 10</strong>.</li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><em>Your opinion as a finance leader is critical to building the momentum needed for real change across the UK higher education sector. </em></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Your peers say it themselves: "There are a lot of basics that need to be put in place that do not currently support an agile high performing team" The numbers confirm it. <strong>While 74% of leaders say the applicant journey is a top priority, the average capability score is just 38%.</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">You can't fix what you can't measure. So, we invite you to join the conversation and give your opinion as to where your institution stands. Your feedback is crucial to building a clearer picture of international admissions in UK higher education.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
