<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://app.edified.co.uk/admissions-navigator-finance?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Complete the free self-assessment survey</u></strong></span></a>: The survey takes approximately 10 minutes and the deadline for submission is <strong>Friday, September 26, 2025.</strong></li> 
<li><strong>Get your personal scorecard</strong>: Receive an individual scorecard showing how your responses align with sector-defined capabilities, highlighting strengths and gaps in eight future-focused areas.</li> 
<li><strong>Unlock a tailored capability report</strong>: If multiple stakeholders from your university complete the survey, you'll receive a detailed report with consolidated insights and practical recommendations for improvement.</li> 
</ul> </td> 
