<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>Your data is handled with care:</strong> All responses are confidential and managed in line with <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.edified.com.au/privacy-policy?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Edified's privacy policy</u></strong></span></a>. Sector-wide insights will be anonymised and aggregated into a summary report.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br /><strong>Missed the info session?</strong> You can access a <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/webinar-admissions-navigator?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>recording </u></strong></span></a>of our recent webinar to learn more about the Admissions Navigator and see the tool in action. <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/webinar-admissions-navigator?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Click here to watch the replay.</u></strong></span></a></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />Don't miss this opportunity to gain valuable insights and contribute to sector-wide research.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">If you have any questions, please contact Sheona Griffiths at <a style="color: #223341;" href="mailto:sheona.griffiths@flywire.com"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>sheona.griffiths@flywire.com</u></strong></span></a>.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />Sincerely,</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">The Flywire, Tribal &amp; Edified Teams</p> </td> 
</tr> 
